- Make sure that all waste has been removed or contained, so that it does not attract rodents, ants and flies;
- Make sure that the house and ownership are safe and free from junk, such as dead leaves and tree trunks;
- Keep doors and windows closed or locked at night and when away from the house;
- Check and replace air filters and clean all ventilation openings and heating/ ventilation tiltes;
- Test all lights and smoke detectors and make a plan on how your friends and neighbors can check your home and the environment, including your garden and garage.
